# Very simple test of new scoring system

Geometry Mesh
   Name MyMesh                    # geometry type
    X -5.0    5.0    1
    Y -5.0    5.0    1
    Z  0.0   20.0  200   # 1 mm steps



Output
         Filename NB_msh.dat
         Fileformat TEXT
         Geo MyMesh
         Quantity Energy
         Quantity Fluence

# BDO format
Output
         Filename NB_msh.bdo
         Geo MyMesh
         Quantity Energy
         Quantity Fluence
